{
  "id": 99600,
  "title": "Jal-ImKot",
  "text": "{{Infobox Monster\n|name = Jal-ImKot\n|image = [[File:Jal-ImKot.png|200px]]\n|release = [[1 June]] [[2017]]\n|update = The Inferno\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 240\n|size = 4\n|examine = Those are some powerful claws.\n|xpbonus = 7.5\n|max hit = 49\n|aggressive = Yes\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Slash]]\n|attack speed = 4\n|slayxp = 81\n|cat = TzHaar\n|assignedby = chaeldar,nieve,duradel\n|hitpoints = 75\n|att = 210\n|str = 290\n|def = 120\n|mage = 120\n|range = 220\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 40\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 65\n|dslash = 65\n|dcrush = 65\n|dmagic = 30\n|drange = 50\n|immunepoison = Yes\n|immunevenom = Yes\n|immuneburn = Immune to normal burn\n|id = 7697\n}}\n'''Jal-ImKot''' is one of the monsters found in the [[Inferno]].\n\nJal-ImKots only use [[melee]], but make up for it with extremely accurate and damaging attacks. If a Jal-ImKot cannot reach the player, it will burrow into the ground and reappear next to the player to attack them. There is a six [[RuneScape clock|game tick]] delay before the Jal-ImKot attacks after resurfacing, so players can use this time to change [[prayers]] or move out of the way.\n\nJal-ImKots dig 50 ticks after the start of a wave, and every 40-60 ticks thereafter. They are unable to dig if they have attacked the player in the last 15 ticks.\n\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 15 March 2018\n|update = QoL, Deadman and the Falador Party Room\n|change = Jal-ImKot can no longer deal damage during its dig animation in the Inferno.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Trivia==\n*This monster closely resembles the Hydralisk unit from ''{{wp|StarCraft}}''.\n\n{{Inferno}}",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"infobox no-parenthesis-style infobox-monster\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-header\">Jal-ImKot</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-image infobox-full-width-content\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Jal-ImKot.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Jal-ImKot.png/200px-Jal-ImKot.png?5b7f9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Jal-ImKot.png/400px-Jal-ImKot.png?5b7f9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1509\" data-file-height=\"1479\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\">Released</th><td colspan=\"16\"><a href=\"/w/1_June\" title=\"1 June\">1 June</a> <a href=\"/w/2017\" title=\"2017\">2017</a> (<a href=\"/w/Update:The_Inferno\" title=\"Update:The Inferno\">Update</a>)</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Members\" title=\"Members\">Members</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Yes</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Combat_level\" title=\"Combat level\">Combat level</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">240</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Size\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Size\">Size</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">4x4</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Examine\" title=\"Examine\">Examine</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Those are some powerful claws.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\">Combat info</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Experience_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Experience bonus\">XP bonus</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">+7.5%</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Monster_maximum_hit\" title=\"Monster maximum hit\">Max hit</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">49</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=