-element\" data-file-width=\"27\" data-file-height=\"30\" /></a></span></th><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Crush_weapons\" title=\"Crush weapons\"><img src=\"/images/White_warhammer.png?2ff77\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"22\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+65</td><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+65</td><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+65</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><img src=\"/images/Magic_defence_icon.png?65b01\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"30\" data-file-height=\"23\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Magic\" title=\"Magic\">Magic defence</a></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"12\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Magic\" title=\"Magic\"><img src=\"/images/Magic_icon.png?334cf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"25\" data-file-height=\"23\" /></a></span></th><th colspan=\"12\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Elemental_weakness\" title=\"No elemental weakness\"><img alt=\"No elemental weakness\" src=\"/images/Pure_essence.png?ed4b0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"29\" data-file-height=\"28\" /></a></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"12\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+30</td><td colspan=\"12\" class=\"infobox-nested\">No elemental weakness</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><img src=\"/images/Ranged_defence_icon.png?d0402\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"28\" data-file-height=\"23\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Ranged\" title=\"Ranged\">Ranged defence</a></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ranged_weapons#Light\" title=\"Light\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/images/Steel_dart.png?3203e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></th><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ranged_weapons#Standard\" title=\"Standard\"><img alt=\"Standard\" src=\"/images/Steel_arrow_5.png?2c4a2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"31\" data-file-height=\"30\" /></a></span></th><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ranged_weapons#Heavy\" title=\"Heavy\"><img alt=\"Heavy\" src=\"/images/Steel_bolts_5.png?f1c11\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"28\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+50</td><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+50</td><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+50</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\">Immunities</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Immune</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Immune</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Burn\" title=\"Burn\">Burn</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Immune to normal burn</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"dps-calc-button infobox-full-width-content\"><div class=\"dps-calc plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tools.runescape.wiki/osrs-dps/?monster=7697\"><span class=\"mw-ui-button dps-calc-openbtn mw-ui-progressive\" style=\"min-height:0; margin-bottom: 8px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Dps_calc_logo.png/32px-Dps_calc_logo.png?bdd0d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Dps_calc_logo.png/64px-Dps_calc_logo.png?bdd0d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1221\" data-file-height=\"1191\" /></span></span> Open in DPS calculator</span></a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\">Advanced data</th></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><th colspan=\"8\">Monster ID</th><td colspan=\"16\">7697</td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"infobox-smw-data\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><b>Jal-ImKot</b> is one of the monsters found in the <a href=\"/w/Inferno\" title=\"Inferno\">Inferno</a>.\n</p><p>Jal-ImKots only use <a href=\"/w/Melee\" title=\"Melee\">melee</a>, but make up for it with extremely accurate and damaging attacks. If a Jal-ImKot cannot reach the player, it will burrow into the ground and reappear next to the player to attack them. There is a six <a href=\"/w/RuneScape_clock\" title=\"RuneScape clock\">game tick</a> delay before the Jal-ImKot attacks after resurfacing, so players can use this time to change <a href=\"/w/Prayers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prayers\">prayers</a> or move out of the way.\n</p><p>Jal-ImKots dig 50 ticks after the start of a wave, and every 40-60 ticks thereafter. They are unable to dig if they have attacked the player in the last 15 ticks.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes\">Changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Jal-ImKot?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" title=\"Edit section: Changes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Jal-ImKot?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Changes\">edit source</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible sortable\" style=\"max-width:800px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Date\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Changes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-sort-value=\"15 March 2018\"><a href=\"/w/15_March\" title=\"15 March\">15&#160;March</a>&#160;<a href=\"/w/2018\" title=\"2018\">2018</a><br />(<a href=\"/w/Update:QoL,_Deadman_and_the_Falador_Party_Room\" title=\"Update:QoL, Deadman and the Falador Party Room\">update</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Jal-ImKot can no longer deal damage during its dig animation in the Inferno.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Jal-ImKot?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Jal-ImKot?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\">edit source</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This monster closely resembles the Hydralisk unit from <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/StarCraft\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:StarCraft\"><span title=\"&quot;StarCraft&quot; on English Wikipedia\">StarCraft</span></a></i>.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox &lt;mw:editsection nowraplinks mw-collapsible mw-collapsed navbox-autocollapse\" data-navbox-name=\"Inferno\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div style=\"float:left;text-align:left\"><div class=\"navbar plainlinks noprint navbar-mini\" style=\"font-weight:normal;font-size:x-small;white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"/w/Template:Inferno\" title=\"Template:Inferno\"><span title=\"View this template\" style=\"\">v</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%\">&#8226;</span>&#160;<span class=\"autoconfirmed-show\" style=\"display:none\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Template_talk:Inferno\"><span title=\"Discussion about this template\" style=\"\">t</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%\">&#8226;</span>&#160;</span><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Template:Inferno?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\" style=\"\">e</span></a></div></div><div class=\"navbox-title-name\"><a href=\"/w/Inferno\" title=\"Inferno\">Inferno</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Monsters</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Jal-Nib\" title=\"Jal-Nib\">Jal-Nib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-MejRah\" title=\"Jal-MejRah\">Jal-MejRah</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-Ak\" title=\"Jal-Ak\">Jal-Ak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-AkRek-Mej\" title=\"Jal-AkRek-Mej\">Jal-AkRek-Mej</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-AkRek-Xil\" title=\"Jal-AkRek-Xil\">Jal-AkRek-Xil</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-AkRek-Ket\" title=\"Jal-AkRek-Ket\">Jal-AkRek-Ket</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Jal-ImKot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-Xil\" title=\"Jal-Xil\">Jal-Xil</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-Zek\" title=\"Jal-Zek\">Jal-Zek</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/JalTok-Jad\" title=\"JalTok-Jad\">JalTok-Jad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Yt-HurKot\" title=\"Yt-HurKot\">Yt-HurKot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/TzKal-Zuk\" title=\"TzKal-Zuk\">TzKal-Zuk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Jal-MejJak\" title=\"Jal-MejJak\">Jal-MejJak</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Items</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Infernal_cape\" title=\"Infernal cape\"><img src=\"/images/Infernal_cape.png?80b36\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"28\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Infernal_cape\" title=\"Infernal cape\">Infernal cape</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Jal-nib-rek\" title=\"Jal-nib-rek\"><img src=\"/images/Jal-nib-rek.png?b3ec1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"27\" data-file-height=\"21\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Jal-nib-rek\" title=\"Jal-nib-rek\">Jal-nib-rek</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Related</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Inferno_(music_track)\" title=\"Inferno (music track)\">Inferno (music track)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Ancestral_Glyph\" title=\"Ancestral Glyph\">Ancestral Glyph</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Rocky_support\" title=\"Rocky support\">Rocky support</a></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐cd96db88f‐b7zwq\nCached time: 20241018141943\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size